    "code": "const inv = (gamma[v] * INV2PI) / (dx * dx + dy * dy + soft2);\nvx -= dy * inv; // perpendicular to the separation: (-dy, dx)\nvy += dx * inv;\n// ...\nlet x = st[o] + vel[i*2] * dt;\nlet y = st[o+1] + vel[i*2+1] * dt;",
