    "code": "// Plummer-softened pairwise acceleration\nconst dx = st[oj] - xi, dy = st[oj+1] - yi, dz = st[oj+2] - zi;\nconst r2 = dx*dx + dy*dy + dz*dz + eps2;\nconst inv = 1 / (r2 * Math.sqrt(r2)); // (r^2+eps^2)^(-3/2)\nconst f = G * m * inv;\naxi += dx*f; ayi += dy*f; azi += dz*f;\na[aj] -= dx*f; a[aj+1] -= dy*f; a[aj+2] -= dz*f; // Newton's 3rd law\n\n// velocity-Verlet step\nst[o]   += st[o+3]*dt + a[ai]*halfDt2;   // drift\nst[o+3] += a[ai]*0.5*dt;                  // half-kick (old accel)\n// ... recompute accel ...\nst[o+3] += a[ai]*0.5*dt;                  // half-kick (new accel)",
